  "horizon_note": "Every specification at the 6-month horizon clears the IC test, and at every other horizon a minority do. That is robust to the specification and confined to one horizon \u2014 which is a real finding and a real limitation in the same sentence. An effect present at one horizon only is not yet distinguishable from a horizon-shaped artefact of a 3-year panel, and it should be quoted with the horizon attached, never as 'the model works'.",
